*   &net0 @WIRE(mode="straight") {#S1:2 %j1};
*   &net0 @WIRE(mode="straight") {%j1 #L1:2};
*   &net0 @WIRE(mode="straight") {#S2:1 %j1};
*   &VSS @WIRE(mode="straight") {#S2:2 %gnd1::pin};
*   &VSS @WIRE(mode="straight") {%gnd2::pin %j2};
